<p align="center"><u><b><font size="7">Server Transfer Guide 2.0</font></b></u></p>
<p align="center"><font color="#0000ff" size="7">Transfer your Everquest Account 
to any server!</font></p>
<p> </p>
<ul>
  <li><font color="#800000" size="5">Did you buy an account, and now you are 
  upset that you cannot transfer to the server you originally wanted to be on?</font>
  </li>
  <li><font color="#800000" size="5">Do you have multiple accounts that you 
  would like to all be on the same server? </font></li>
  <li><font color="#800000" size="5">Are you discouraged about paying $75 
  dollars to Sony for a character move with items?</font> </li>
  <li><font color="#800000" size="5">Is there an account you would like to buy, 
  but the only reason you are not is because you cannot move this account to the 
  server you play on?</font> </li>
</ul>
<p><font color="#000080" size="5">Fret no more. I am now offering you for the 
low price of $29.99 everything you need to know about transfering your character 
to another server without having to pay the $75 dollars it normally costs. Use 
the Buy Now and once payment is received I will email you my eGuide on how it is 
done. I have helped lots of people do this already. Just check my feedback, so 
get your guide now while it still works! Only a few people are aware of how this 
works and those people got the information from me originally. Below some of the 
most common concerns and questions are answered.</font></p>
<p><font size="4">Q: Are there any other costs involved in this?</font></p>
</a>
<p><font size="4">A: Yes, there is another small additional fee of 27 dollars to 
move to Legends server. Even if you factor into the cost of moving just one 
character, it is still cheaper than what Sony currently charges, and you do not 
have to be the original owner for this to work. This guide is a 10 Step guide, 
which must be followed very carefully to work, but you can move as many 
characters as you want, and you only have to pay the 29.99 Fee one time for the 
guide itself. Then it is just 27 dollars every 4 characters you move cost wise.</font></p>
<p> </p>
<p><font size="4">Q: How long does it take?</font></p>
<p><font size="4">A: The complete process takes about 30 days to complete. In 
this 30 days you will also get a free name change and possibly some cool gear 
you might not have otherwise gotten for your character.</font></p>
<a name="DESC">
<p> </p>
<p><font size="4">Q: I am not the Original owner, can I still move my character 
without the original CD keys and Credit Card info?</font></p>
<p><font size="4">A: Yes you can, this method does not require you to know any 
of that information.</font></p>
<p> </p>
<p><font size="4">Q: Can this method get my account banned?</font></p>
<p><font size="4">A: No, I have done this many times and have never had any 
account banned because of it.</font></p>
<p> </p>
<p><font size="4">Q: Do you work for Sony, are you are possibly a rogue CS Rep 
that is trying to make a quick buck?</font></p>
<p><font size="4">A: No, I simply was able to discover a loophole in the system 
which worked in my favor</font></p>
<p> </p>
<p><font size="4">Q: Does this work for more than one account?</font></p>
<p><font size="4">A: Yes, this will work for as many accounts as you would like.</font></p>
<p> </p>
<p><font size="4">Q: Do you need my Station name and Password to do it?</font></p>
<p><font size="4">A: No, I will simply give you an eGuide which I wrote in great 
detail, so you can do this yourself.</font></p>
<p> </p>
<p><font size="4">Q: Will you move my account for me and let me pay you after it 
is done?</font></p>
<p><font size="4">A: No, I have neither the time nor the patience to move 
everyone's account for them. Just buy the guide and do it yourself.</font></p>
<p> </p>
</a>
<p><font size="4">Q: Can I move my characters to another account with this?</font></p>
<p><font size="4">A: No, this is a server transfer guide, not an Account 
transfer guide.</font></p>

